<title>UK: BSKYB TO POST FULL-YEAR FIGURES ON FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>BSKYB TO POST FULL-YEAR FIGURES ON FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay television company BSkyB Plc will report its results for the year to June 30 1997 on Friday August 15, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
